    "detailed_description": "<strong>I told you there is no game!</strong><br>It's not like it\u2019s a Point&amp;Click that won the 2015 Construct Deception Jam, or that millions of people have tried it.<br>Of course not!<br>And if you\u2019ve never heard of it, now\u2019s the perfect time to go for a walk, read a book... or something\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEAK POINTS:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>It's free, which is a problem when you go to ask for a refund.<br></li><li>The voice-over acting is pathetic.<br></li><li>There are only two different endings, which you\u2019ll never even get to because you\u2019re not going to install it.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HIGHLIGHTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Since there's no game, you'll be saving a lot of time. Isn't that great?<br></li><li>It contains a keyboard shortcut that simplifies your progress: ALT+F4</li></ul><br><br><i>If, despite all these warnings, you \u201chad fun,\u201d we strongly advise you not to click on the following image to discover &quot;THERE IS NO GAME: Wrong dimension&quot;.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1241700/extras/c173b70ac07fb44495c55c415c1dd073.avif?t=1666983908\" /></div><br><br>No, really... don't do it.</i><br><br>",
